ff":"","icon":"UI_Talent_S_Alyosha_06","linkedConstellations":null},"6":{"skillId":14823,"type":2,"name":"Into the Fray","description":"Alyosha will enter the <color=#FFD780FF>Radiance: Stellar-Conduct</color> state when inside a {LINK#N11330003}<color=#FFD780FF>Polestar Field</color>{/LINK}.\\n<color=#FFD780FF>Radiance: Stellar-Conduct</color>: The <color=#FFD780FF>Hunter's Precision</color> effect obtained when the {LINK#N11480001}<color=#FFD780FF>Hunter's Mark</color>{/LINK} is activated will also increase Stellar-Conduct reaction DMG dealt by the character when on the field by 20%.","descriptionBuff":"","icon":"UI_Talent_S_Alyosha_07","effects":["N11330003","N11480001"],"linkedConstellations":null},"8":{"skillId":14825,"type":2,"name":"Treetop Watch","description":"Displays the location of nearby <color=#FFD780FF>resources unique to Snezhnaya</color> on the mini-map, and this effect also applies in the Shadow Realm.","descriptionBuff":"","icon":"UI_Talent_S_Alyosha_08","linkedConstellations":null}},"constellation":{"0":{"id":0,"talentId":1481,"name":"Frostvale Thunderclap","description":"Alyosha regenerates 15 Elemental Energy when nearby party members trigger an <color=#FFACFFFF>Electro-related reaction</color> on an opponent. This effect can trigger once every 18s.","descriptionBuff":null,"extraData":null,"icon":"UI_Talent_S_Alyosha_01"},"1":{"id":1,"talentId":1482,"name":"Howl From Afar","description":"The duration of the Elemental Burst <color=#FFD780FF>Hunter's Advance</color> is extended by 6s.\\nAdditionally, each time {LINK#N11480002}<color=#FFD780FF>Tugarin</color>{/LINK} attacks the opponent, he will also apply the {LINK#N11480001}<color=#FFD780FF>Hunter's Mark</color>{/LINK} to a target. This effect does not activate existing <color=#FFD780FF>Hunter's Marks</color>.","descriptionBuff":null,"extraData":null,"icon":"UI_Talent_S_Alyosha_02","effects":["N11480002","N11480001"]},"2":{"id":2,"talentId":1483,"name":"Friendly Call","description":"Increases the Level of the Elemental Skill <color=#FFD780FF>Thunderbolt Strike</color> by 3.\\nMaximum upgrade level is 15.","descriptionBuff":null,"extraData":null,"icon":"UI_Talent_U_Alyosha_01"},"3":{"id":3,"talentId":1484,"name":"Harvest the Spoils","description":"When {LINK#N11480002}<color=#FFD780FF>Tugarin</color>{/LINK} attacks, he will also restore 60% of Alyosha's ATK as HP to the nearby party member with the lowest HP by percentage.","descriptionBuff":null,"extraData":null,"icon":"UI_Talent_S_Alyosha_03","effects":["N11480002"]},"4":{"id":4,"talentId":1485,"name":"When the Nightbird Falls Silent","description":"Increases the Level of the Elemental Burst <color=#FFD780FF>Hunter's Advance</color> by 3.\\nMaximum upgrade level is 15.","descriptionBuff":null,"extraData":null,"icon":"UI_Talent_U_Alyosha_02"},"5":{"id":5,"talentId":1486,"name":"Standard Reclaimed","description":"The <color=#FFD780FF>Hunter's Precision</color> effect obtained from activating a {LINK#N11480001}<color=#FFD780FF>Hunter's Mark</color>{/LINK} can now stack, max 2 stacks. When the stack count reaches 2, characters affected by <color=#FFD780FF>Hunter's Precision</color> will also have their Elemental Mastery increased by 100 if they are on the field.","descriptionBuff":null,"extraData":null,"icon":"UI_Talent_S_Alyosha_04","effects":["N11480001"]}},"dictionary":{"talent":["N11480001","N11480002","N11330003"],"constellation":["N11480002","N11480001"],"effectsInfo":{"N11480001":{"id":11480001,"name":"Hunter's Mark","description":"A special effect Alyosha can apply on the opponent.\\nWhen this effect is applied to an opponent who is already under the <color=#FFD780FF>Hunter's Mark</color> effect, it will activate <color=#FFD780FF>Hunter's Mark</color> instead, which removes said mark and grants all nearby party members the <color=#FFD780FF>Hunter's Precision</color> effect, which increases their ATK when they are on the field.","params":null,"props":["","","","",""]},"N11480002":{"id":11480002,"name":"Tugarin","description":"Alyosha's trusted hunting hound and companion, which can be summoned to the field using the Elemental Burst <color=#FFD780FF>Hunter's Advance</color>.\\nPeriodically moves close to an opponent to maul them, and activate any existing <color=#FFD780FF>Hunter's Marks</color>.","params":null,"props":["","","","",""]},"N11330003":{"id":11330003,"name":"Polestar Field","description":"When Stellar-Conduct is triggered, the surrounding area will transform into a <color=#FFD780FF>Polestar Field</color> for a short period of time, and when inside a Polestar Field, certain characters will enter the <color=#FFD780FF>Radiance: Stellar-Conduct</color> state, which grants various skill buffs.","params":null,"props":["","","","",""]}}}}}